" commands                          left.txt                          right.txt                      "
" Navigate                        │   1 alpha                           1 alpha                      "
" j/k     down / up               │   2 beta                       -                                 "
" PgDn/Up page down / up          │   3 gamma                           2 gamma                      "
" g/G     top / bottom            │   4 delta                      ~    3 delta changed              "
" n/p     next / prev change      │                                +    4 zeta                       "
" h/l     scroll left / right     │   5 epsilon                         5 epsilon                    "
"                                 │                                                                  "
" Compare                         │                                                                  "
" w       whitespace        exact │                                                                  "
" i       ignore case         off │                                                                  "
" b       ignore blank lines  off │                                                                  "
" e       ignore line endings  on │                                                                  "
"                                 │                                                                  "
" View                            │                                                                  "
" u       layout     side-by-side │                                                                  "
"                                 │                                                                  "
" General                         │                                                                  "
" Tab     toggle this sidebar     │                                                                  "
" Tab ←/→ dock left / right       │                                                                  "
" ?       toggle help             │                                                                  "
" q/Esc   quit or go back         │                                                                  "
" Ctrl-c  quit from anywhere      │                                                                  "
